  "description": "Shimmering gold satin bows and pearl strands meet delicate ivory lace on a blush pink background in this ultra-glamorous luxury surface pattern.\nThis opulent design features large gold satin ribbon bows as the primary motif, rendered with realistic metallic sheen and soft shadow detail. Secondary elements include strands of cream pearl beads, a faceted gold perfume bottle with an ornate label, scattered rose petals in champagne tones, a gold lace doily with intricate floral scrollwork, a decorative gold fleur-de-lis ornament, and an elegant monogram crest with a crown. The overall composition is scattered and allover, giving a curated flat-lay editorial aesthetic reminiscent of high-end fashion styling.\nThe colour story is anchored in warm champagne gold, soft blush pink, antique ivory, and creamy pearl white — a palette that radiates femininity, opulence, and bridal elegance. The mood is romantic, luxurious, and celebratory, evoking Parisian couture and vintage glamour. This pattern is ideal for sublimation printing on tumblers, mugs, and phone cases, as well as gift wrap, bridal stationery, scrapbooking papers, fabric yardage, pillow covers, and digital backgrounds for Canva templates or Procreate mood boards. It suits wedding planning content, feminine brand kits, boutique packaging, and luxury Etsy product photography backdrops.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Shimmering gold satin bows and pearl strands meet delicate ivory lace on a blush pink background in this ultra-glamorous luxury surface pattern.</p>\n<p>This opulent design features large gold satin ribbon bows as the primary motif, rendered with realistic metallic sheen and soft shadow detail. Secondary elements include strands of cream pearl beads, a faceted gold perfume bottle with an ornate label, scattered rose petals in champagne tones, a gold lace doily with intricate floral scrollwork, a decorative gold fleur-de-lis ornament, and an elegant monogram crest with a crown. The overall composition is scattered and allover, giving a curated flat-lay editorial aesthetic reminiscent of high-end fashion styling.</p>\n<p>The colour story is anchored in warm champagne gold, soft blush pink, antique ivory, and creamy pearl white — a palette that radiates femininity, opulence, and bridal elegance. The mood is romantic, luxurious, and celebratory, evoking Parisian couture and vintage glamour. This pattern is ideal for sublimation printing on tumblers, mugs, and phone cases, as well as gift wrap, bridal stationery, scrapbooking papers, fabric yardage, pillow covers, and digital backgrounds for Canva templates or Procreate mood boards. It suits wedding planning content, feminine brand kits, boutique packaging, and luxury Etsy product photography backdrops.</p>",
